        "original_id": "f606bfcd-4658-53b8-9d19-314443adc7bb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Bokor Hill Station\n- Products: City of Ghosts, R-Point\n- People: Kam Woo-sung, Son Byong-ho\n- Events: Vietnam War\n- Topics: 1972 Vietnam, South Korean military in Vietnam\n\nFacts:\n- The film City of Ghosts was released in 2002.\n- The film R-Point is set in 1972 Vietnam during the Vietnam War.\n- The film R-Point stars Kam Woo-sung and Son Byong-ho as members of the South Korean military in Vietnam.\n- Bokor Hill Station was used as the location for the final showdown of the 2002 movie City of Ghosts.\n- Bokor Hill Station was also used as a location for the 2004 film R-Point.",
